            <ArticleTitle>A limited form of Churg-Strauss syndrome presenting without asthma and eosinophilia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>498-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a young woman presenting with digital gangrene, paranasal sinusitis, mononeuritis multiplex, and rapidly progressive glomerulonephritis without asthma and eosinophilia - an extremely rare variant of this disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
